  dialogues:
  - speaker: 'Narrator '
    text: The screen fades from black. We see Harry, in prison clothes, sitting in
      a dimly lit Azkaban cell, staring at the wall. A rat watches him, clearly disappointed
  - speaker: Wizard Nguyen
    text: "You know\u2026 I\u2019ve done a lot of dumb things in my life"
  - speaker: Wizard Nguyen
    text: 'Time-traveled without a license? '
  - speaker: Wizard Nguyen
    text: "But nothing\u2014and I mean nothing\u2014was dumber than ignoring wizarding
      traffic laws"
  - speaker: Wizard Nguyen
    text: 'All because of a broom crash.Now i ended up in prison. '
  - speaker: Wizard Nguyen
    text: How unlucky.
  - speaker: Wizard Nguyen
    text: "And now, I gotta break out of here\u2026 before they make me take a mandatory
      broom safety course"
